  "prefLabel": "He-C 5004.09 Non-Covered Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5004.09 Non-Covered Services. Installation to provide telehealth services or maintenance of telehealth hardware, software, or other equipment shall not be covered by Medicaid.\n\nSource. #13651, eff 5-26-23",
